[00:01] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'The world of filmmaking has changed radically in the past few months. And in this video, we\'ll look at an incredible example of how AI is changing the way we tell stories . Up until this point in the history of'

[00:14] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'cinema, when you sat down to edit a project, you were limited to only the footage that was shot on location. The alternative would be to conduct a very expensive reshoot, and of course, that could hit the'

[00:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'budget significantly. But in this video, I\'ll show you how you can change the angle of view of your footage so that it\'s virtually indistinguishable from the original. I\'ll also show you a glimpse into'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the future of mobile cinema, transforming a simple video into a high-budget cinematic landscape. We have a lot to discuss, so let \'s get started. I want to thank'

[00:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Christopher Gwin for inspiring me for this video tutorial with his tests in Minimax H3. So, let\'s prepare the ground. I have a video of this woman just'

[01:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'posing near a building. You see her doing certain actions: looking at the camera, touching her skateboard, and just navigating the space. But let\'s assume that for'

[01:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'some reason the material is damaged or we need a general plan of the same frame. How do you do this without returning to the location to reshoot? Well, to make this'

[01:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'happen, there are several tools available. One of them is SeaDance 2.0 and 2.5. The other one is Minimax H3. All of these tools are among the best AI solutions'

[01:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'for video on the market today. To generate our clip, I\'ll use an online aggregator called Magnific, but you can use any AI tool that supports these'

[01:53] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'models. So, I\'m in the video generation section and I choose SeaDance 2.5. You will also notice that there are many other AI models available for video in Magnific. Now'

[02:05] [scene:talk]
