AUDIO: 'let\'s load our original material. Here\'s this clip where the woman is looking into the camera, and we\'ll add it to the assets section. I will not read the entire'

[02:17] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'prompt in full. Essentially, we are tasked with reproducing the original clip as a general shot from a different camera position. You can be more specific about where exactly the camera should be . For example,'

[02:29] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'if you want to upload a diagram image showing the location of the camera relative to an object, you can certainly do that. Or you can leave more room for creative interpretation of C Dance. It all depends on how flexible'

[02:41] [scene:talk]
